# zig-ndk.
#
# This package ships Zig source that *describes* an Android NDK sysroot. No
# NDK, Google or LLVM artefact is redistributed in this tree: it contains no C,
# no NDK header, and no part of any Google or LLVM binary. The NDK itself is
# licensed by its publisher, is not vendored or copied here, and is read at
# build time from wherever the consumer's NDK lives.
#
# Portions of this repository are reproduced from the Zig standard library. See
# NOTICE.md for what was taken, from where, and why.
#
# The Android NDK is not MIT licensed, and nixpkgs does not classify it as free.
# `devenv.nix` and the CI `link` job download and unpack NDK r29 under Google's
# Android SDK Terms — https://developer.android.com/studio/terms, reproduced on
# the download page at https://developer.android.com/ndk/downloads — so entering
# `devenv shell` downloads a licence-restricted artefact. Read those terms
# before you do. This repository takes no position on what they allow.

